abstract: "An evidence-led guide to statistical, optimal-transport, deep generative and foundation-model approaches for T1-T3. Includes a machine-readable catalog of 28 primary papers, task-specific failure modes, pseudo-holdout and ablation plans, and the falsifiable EmbryoBridge shared architecture."
